  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LPDP-NL Joint Scholarship Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesian mid-career professionals who aim to contribute to Indonesia&#x201a;&#xc4;&#xf4;s sustainable and inclusive development</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Selected students are provided a scholarship for a one year master&apos;s programme at participating Dutch universities</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The scholarship programme aims to optimise the resources that the collaborating organisations have by focusing on specific areas that are mutually relevant and important to Indonesia&apos;s development priorities, the development of key expertise in the Dutch knowledge sector, and the bilateral cooperation agenda of the two countries</narrative>
  </description>
